    "intro_html":  "Ham and bean soup is the original leftover recipe. Somebody figured out a long time ago that the least valuable part of a ham makes the best pot of soup, and nobody has improved on it since. Diced ham, white beans, tomatoes and the usual carrot, celery and onion base. It carries {{protein}} grams of protein for about ${{cost_ps}} a bowl (at everyday cost).",
